{"id":"verletzter","lemma":"Verletzter","pos":"noun","rank":3770,"glosses":["injured (person), casualty (male or of unspecified gender)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e9/De-Verletzter.ogg/De-Verletzter.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Verletzten","plural":"Verletzte","feminine":"Verletzte"},"examples":[{"text":"Ein verletzter Wal wurde am Strand angespült.","en":"A wounded whale washed up on the beach.","words":[{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"whale"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"beach"},{"g":"to wash up, be cast up","l":"anspülen"}]},{"text":"Seine Worte verletzten ihre Gefühle.","en":"His words hurt her feelings.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},{"g":"word as an isolated unit","l":"Wort"},null,{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},{"g":"feeling","l":"Gefühl"}]},{"text":"Ich verletzte mich am rechten Bein.","en":"I got my right leg injured.","words":[{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"at the / on the"},{"g":"to argue"},{"g":"leg of a person"}]},{"text":"Wie geht es dem verletzten Spieler?","en":"How's the player that got hurt?","words":[null,null,null,{"g":"(to) the","l":"der"},null,{"g":"to play","l":"spielen"}],"phrases":[[0,3,"how are you"]]},{"text":"Es gab viele Verletzte.","en":"There were many wounded.","words":[{"g":"it"},{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null]}]}